{"2143790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DeAnima", "steam_appid": 2143790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into the abyss, where every step confronts the darkness within.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeAnima</i> is a first-person dungeon crawler that resurrects the unforgiving spirit of the original <i>Rogue</i> for a modern audience. Set in a sprawling, medieval dungeon steeped in dark fantasy, you embody a lone wanderer seeking the fabled Crown of Nivek. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About DeAnima</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Traditional Roguelike</strong>: Experience true permadeath, turn-based exploration, and randomized dungeons, heavily inspired by the game that started it all back in the 80s! Every run is a unique, merciless challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Immersion</strong>: Navigate a medieval dungeon with moody visuals and an oppressive atmosphere, where every shadow hides a threat or a secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Survival</strong>: Face monstrous demons with scarce resources and tough choices. Progress by mastering your environment, not overpowering it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Depths</strong>: Many secrets lurk in the darkness, offering paths to enlightenment or ruin. The dungeon’s truths are yours to discover.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Dungeons</strong>: Explore procedurally generated labyrinths where no two runs are alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving Permadeath</strong>: Every death is final, raising the stakes with each choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Item Discovery</strong>: Master a deep identification system to uncover the secrets of 80+ unique items, including potions, scrolls, wands, rings, and bags.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Roguelike Experience</strong>: No meta-progression - every run starts from zero, testing your skill and cunning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat</strong>: Time pauses with your inaction, giving you the space to plan your next move or escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Enhancement</strong>: Enchant and Vorpalize your weapons to gain a deadly edge in the dungeon’s darkest depths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into the abyss, where every step confronts the darkness within.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeAnima</i> is a first-person dungeon crawler that resurrects the unforgiving spirit of the original <i>Rogue</i> for a modern audience. Set in a sprawling, medieval dungeon steeped in dark fantasy, you embody a lone wanderer seeking the fabled Crown of Nivek. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About DeAnima</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Traditional Roguelike</strong>: Experience true permadeath, turn-based exploration, and randomized dungeons, heavily inspired by the game that started it all back in the 80s! Every run is a unique, merciless challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Immersion</strong>: Navigate a medieval dungeon with moody visuals and an oppressive atmosphere, where every shadow hides a threat or a secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Survival</strong>: Face monstrous demons with scarce resources and tough choices. Progress by mastering your environment, not overpowering it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Depths</strong>: Many secrets lurk in the darkness, offering paths to enlightenment or ruin. The dungeon’s truths are yours to discover.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Dungeons</strong>: Explore procedurally generated labyrinths where no two runs are alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving Permadeath</strong>: Every death is final, raising the stakes with each choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Item Discovery</strong>: Master a deep identification system to uncover the secrets of 80+ unique items, including potions, scrolls, wands, rings, and bags.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Roguelike Experience</strong>: No meta-progression - every run starts from zero, testing your skill and cunning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat</strong>: Time pauses with your inaction, giving you the space to plan your next move or escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Enhancement</strong>: Enchant and Vorpalize your weapons to gain a deadly edge in the dungeon’s darkest depths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "DeAnima is a brutal yet rewarding dungeon crawler steeped in classic roguelike tradition. Set in a sprawling, medieval dungeon, you embody a lone wanderer seeking the fabled Crown of Nivek.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143790/5fed12d6c9b593e626310c7b4e63f3ea9e008372/header.jpg?t=1788019075", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143790/7658694151fd9a7de83f5002b99c00e231bd9c13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788019075", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143790/7658694151fd9a7de83f5002b99c00e231bd9c13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788019075", "website": "https://deanimagame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum"